**Per-state:**
- `loading` — `.message` becomes a pill-shaped shimmering skeleton bar (sweeping gradient, 1.5s), glow dimmed, `.status` pulses.
- `ready` — staggered `rise` spring entrance (`cubic-bezier(.18,.9,.24,1.02)`) at 0/80/160/260/340 ms across eyebrow→title→message→status→meta; message then runs an 11s gradient shimmer; `.meta__dot` turns green with a `beacon` halo pulse.
- `error` — card border/shadow tokens shift to red+amber, message gradient becomes danger→amber, glow retints, `.status` becomes a monospace pill with red hairline border, tinted fill and a pulsing red dot; meta dot goes red; `.page:has(...)` retints orbs 1 & 2 (pure enhancement).

Responsive at 640 (left-aligned editorial layout, smaller blur/radius), 1024, 1800 (64rem/72rem card, wider blur). `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` kills every animation/transition but parks the message gradient at a good offset, flattens the skeleton and keeps the specular line visible so the static composition still reads.

